1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,117
Fasal ka daam nahi milta. Ab kya karein?

2
00:00:03,417 --> 00:00:08,222
Bapu, doodh ka daam roz milta hai! Do achhi gaay laao, dairy shuru karo!

3
00:00:08,522 --> 00:00:12,290
Gaay to mehngi aati hai, Rahul. Paisa kahan se laayein?

4
00:00:12,590 --> 00:00:17,688
Do gaay aur shed, lagbhag dedh lakh. Pashupalan ke liye loan bhi mil jaayega.

5
00:00:17,988 --> 00:00:24,134
Achhi nasl lo, samay pe teeka lagwao, aur hara chara khud ugao. Kharcha bahut kam ho jaayega.

6
00:00:24,684 --> 00:00:29,870
Bhola, roz 20 litre doodh chahiye, mithai ke liye. Shuddh hona chahiye!

7
00:00:30,170 --> 00:00:34,888
Ekdam shuddh, Lala ji. 55 rupaye litre, ghar pahuncha denge.

8
00:00:35,188 --> 00:00:41,331
Do gaay, roz 24 litre, yaani 1,300 ki bikri. Chara nikaal kar bhi aadha bachega.

9
00:00:41,631 --> 00:00:45,856
Phir paneer, ghee aur dahi banao. Usme doodh se zyada munafa hai.

10
00:00:46,156 --> 00:00:50,012
Doodh ki nadiyan, paison ki baarish! Bhola ki life set!
